Aether Server
-------------
This system is managed with systemd and administrated over SSH with sudo.
Useful first checks:

  systemctl --failed          failed units
  journalctl -b -p err         boot errors
  aether-security-status       security posture
  aether-firewall status       open ports
  aether-directory status      Active Directory status

Roles selected at install are recorded in /etc/aether/server-roles.json.
Replace every placeholder password and key shown in that file's notes before
putting this machine on a network.